flowchart TD
  STAGE["Versioned workflow stage with idempotency key"] --> RUN["Execute approved activity"]
  RUN --> TYPE{"Outcome class"}
  TYPE -->|Success| HASH["Commit output and provenance hash"]
  TYPE -->|Transient outage| RETRY["Bounded backoff, verified cache or provider fallback"]
  RETRY --> REST{"Recovered within policy?"}
  REST -->|Yes| HASH
  REST -->|No| FAIL["Explicit unavailable stage and alert"]
  TYPE -->|Scientific invalidity| BLOCK["Fail closed; method review required"]
  TYPE -->|Disclosure violation| SECURITY["Security incident and stop external processing"]
  TYPE -->|Revoked source| REVAL["Create new version and revalidate impacted reports"]
  HASH --> NEXT["Next durable stage"]
  FAIL --> DRAFT["Restricted draft and evidence gap"]
  BLOCK --> DRAFT
